        "TileImage": "$($repository 5403294c-5390-46ba-a246-4bb6108253c0).Image",
        "Description": "Good evening, Agent Rubanana.\r\rYour targets are Phinas Whitmer, Lucian Barker, and Ray Gibson.\r\rThree suspects in a recent produce heist which saw over $2 million worth of prime potassium disappear.\r\rSince they have shattered the worlds of our client, Tropiculture Industries, it is time we shatter something of theirs... ideally their heads.\r\rPacify them with your weapons-grade nana and crash a chandelier on them.\r\rLet&apos;s split up this trio.",
